\newlabel{fig:fdm_slab}{{2}{12}{Dark-matter density slice of the $128\,h^{-1}$Mpc, $1024^3$ hybrid-fluid FDM run ($m_a=10^{-22}$\,eV) at $z=3.5$, a regime inaccessible to pure wave discretisations at this resolution (section~\ref {sec:fdm_box})}{figure.2}{}}
